  data: {
    LLM: 'Stop when you are close to 21 and the banker may bust; avoid taking tiles that risk busting. Remember blank can be 0 or 7 to flex your total.\n\nConsider how many tiles the banker has drawn and visible totals; more tiles in your hand multiplies payout (squared) so sometimes taking one more tile is worth the bust risk.\n\nDouble-blank + one tile for exactly 21 with three tiles beats everything; aim for that when the stake is high.',
    Player: 'Stop when you are close to 21 and the banker may bust; avoid taking tiles that risk busting. Remember blank can be 0 or 7 to flex your total.\n\nConsider how many tiles the banker has drawn and visible totals; more tiles in your hand multiplies payout (squared) so sometimes taking one more tile is worth the bust risk.\n\nDouble-blank + one tile for exactly 21 with three tiles beats everything; aim for that when the stake is high.',
